flowchart LR
    U([Analyst question]) --> E[TextToSQL engine]
    S[(Semantic layer<br/>glossary · rules · examples)] --> E
    E <-->|prompt / JSON| L[OpenAI LLM]
    E -->|SQL| X[Safe executor<br/>read-only sandbox]
    X -.->|error: self-correct| E
    X <--> D[(SQLite<br/>NPL portfolio)]
    G[Data generator<br/>+ quality checks] --> D
    X -->|rows| A[Answer<br/>summary · chart · table]
    A --> UI([Streamlit UI / CLI])
